#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:1 f454d23c91664233a582f261d4ed6403
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Getting started"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:3 5dc3ef3881c744b1b71344720a695acc
msgid "UniKT 是一个基于 PyTorch 和 PyTorch Geometric 构建的统一知识追踪研究实验框架。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT is a unified research and experimentation framework for knowledge "
"tracing, built on PyTorch and PyTorch Geometric."

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:5 09659e5f9a5d411aa7f05b2b8af2002e
msgid "什么是知识追踪"
msgstr "What is knowledge tracing"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:7 18e12e6cdd0c47758605e84c0a3f24d0
msgid "知识追踪是对学习者的知识状态随时间进行建模的任务，基于其历史交互数据（回答的题目、练习的技能以及正确性结果）。其目标是预测学习者在未来题目上的表现，从而实现个性化学习。"
msgstr ""
"Knowledge tracing is the task of modeling a learner's knowledge state over "
"time based on their historical interaction data (questions answered, skills "
"practiced, and correctness outcomes). Its goal is to predict the learner's "
"future performance on questions, enabling personalized learning."

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:9 059ea5e267ae4d6daed7eff9b8c0b1c8
msgid "UniKT 提供的功能"
msgstr "What UniKT provides"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:11 0e3f44fb84b0494db04f6f691cf2c79c
msgid "UniKT 提供从数据到评估的完整流程："
msgstr "UniKT covers the complete pipeline from data to evaluation:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:13 cad56a724c0443b199c13e92dd7ccc71
msgid "**统一 API**：使用相同的 CLI 和训练器 API 训练任何模型"
msgstr "**Unified API**: train any model with the same CLI and trainer API"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:14 099a6b6eb92e4a2697e3412db83ccccd
msgid ""
"**35 "
"个内置模型**：覆盖图神经网络（GKT、GIKT、SGKT、DyGKT、HDHKT）和序列/注意力架构（DKT、AKT、SimpleKT）等方向"
msgstr ""
"**35 built-in models**: covering graph neural networks (GKT, GIKT, SGKT, "
"DyGKT, HDHKT) and sequential/attention architectures (DKT, AKT, SimpleKT), "
"among others"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:15 86ae9fa63d234bd98d29b2033f24a75f
msgid ""
"**11 "
"个支持的数据集**：ASSISTments（2009/2012/2015/2017）、Algebra（2005/2006）、Bridge2006"
"、EdNet-KT1、Junyi、NIPS2020_T34、Slepemapy"
msgstr ""
"**11 supported datasets**: ASSISTments (2009/2012/2015/2017), Algebra "
"(2005/2006), Bridge2006, EdNet-KT1, Junyi, NIPS2020_T34, and Slepemapy"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:16 f2be9fde0d174f938ccbf9673365b7a4
msgid "**实验管理**：K 折交叉验证、超参数搜索（Optuna）、消融实验"
msgstr ""
"**Experiment management**: K-fold cross validation, hyperparameter search "
"(Optuna), and ablation studies"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:18 ca22eeffd3004df085dfa37deb180513
msgid "框架设计"
msgstr "Framework design"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.md:20 6f51af2403c14d95aca216c1bfc41b94
msgid "UniKT 通过装饰器自动发现模型、训练器、数据源和配置——只需在代码中添加一行装饰器，无需手动编辑注册文件。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT auto-discovers models, trainers, data sources, and configurations via "
"decorators — just add a single decorator line in your code, with no need to "
"manually edit registration files."
